      "question": "[Sample] Which Article of the Constitution of India deals with the \"Abolition of Untouchability\"?",
      "questionHindi": "[नमूना] भारतीय संविधान का कौन सा अनुच्छेद \"अस्पृश्यता के उन्मूलन\" से संबंधित है?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Article 15"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Article 16"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Article 17"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Article 18"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "explanation": "Article 17 abolishes untouchability and forbids its practice in any form.",
